    synopsis: "Investigative journalist Maya rents a cliffside cabin on Crimson Cove to look into an ocean salvage operation. What she encounters is Captain Daniel Thorne, a fiercely private mariner with nautical charts that should not exist. When secrets from the deep wash ashore, their intense chemistry becomes impossible to ignore.",
